@startuml Sequence_Normal_Round
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Client as "Client Node"
participant Gateway as "FastAPI Gateway"
participant Coordinator as "Coordinator State Machine"
folder Storage as "File Storage (.safetensors)"
database DB as "PostgreSQL"

== Task Polling & Model Download ==
loop Task Polling
    Client -> Gateway : GET /task (client_id)
    Gateway -> Coordinator : Get Current Round State
    Coordinator --> Gateway : Round State (OPEN, round_id=t, deadline, config)
    Gateway --> Client : TaskAssignment (round_id=t, deadline, hyperparams)
end

Client -> Gateway : GET /model/{run_id}/{version=t}
Gateway -> Storage : Fetch global_model_v{t}.safetensors
Storage --> Gateway : Model file bytes + Checksum
Gateway --> Client : Stream model weights + SHA-256
Client -> Client : Verify SHA-256 integrity

== Local Training ==
Note over Client
  Train PyTorch model locally:
  - Local dataset partition
  - Local epochs (E) & learning rate (eta)
  - Compute FedAvg weights or FedProx proximal loss
  - Record pre/post training metrics (loss, F1)
  - Compute update delta & SHA-256
End Note

== Update Upload ==
Client -> Gateway : POST /update (run_id, round_id, update_id, num_samples, weights, sha256)
Gateway -> DB : Check idempotency & stale status (UNIQUE run_id, round_id, client_id)
alt Duplicate or Stale Update
    Gateway --> Client : 409 Conflict / 400 Bad Request
else Valid Update
    Gateway -> Storage : Save client_{client_id}_v{t}.safetensors
    Gateway -> DB : Insert update record, metrics, bytes_transferred
    Gateway --> Client : 200 OK (UpdateAck accepted=true)
end

== Round Aggregation ==
Coordinator -> Coordinator : Check Quorum (min_participants reached OR timeout)
Coordinator -> Coordinator : Transition State: AGGREGATING
Coordinator -> Storage : Read all accepted client updates for round t
Coordinator -> Coordinator : Execute FedAvg / FedProx Aggregation
Coordinator -> Storage : Save new global_model_v{t+1}.safetensors
Coordinator -> DB : Commit round summary, duration, ML metrics (loss, accuracy, F1)
Coordinator -> Coordinator : Advance to round t + 1 (State: OPEN)
@enduml
